        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(1) All regular full time employees assigned to the night shift shall receive Ten Percent (10%) Premium Pay above their regular salary. Where the Company employs a night crew consisting of four (4) or more employees and working a minimum of four (4) nights per week, there shall be appointed a Night Crew Chief, who shall then be compensated an additional Ten ($10.00) Dollars per week.",
